      <body>
        <h1>THEXRA ENTERPRISE SOLUTION BRIEF</h1>
        <h2>1. Client Problem Statement</h2><p>UrbanHave Properties faces operational strain as front desk staff manually answer calls and text messages for late-night minor maintenance issues like leaky taps and lost keys, causing severe staff overload and delaying urgent facility repairs.</p>
        <h2>2. Proposed Solution</h2><p>A responsive, cross-platform Mobile/Web self-service portal powered by THEXRA View that replaces manual phone calls and text messaging with automated interactive troubleshooting workflows and automated ticket triage.</p>
        <h2>3. Technology Selection</h2><p>Mobile/Web — THEXRA View (Property Edition)</p>
      </body>
